<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23762" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῖπνον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>meal</i>: in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> sts. <i>noonday meal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				11.86
			</span></i>; sts. 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄριστον</span>
			, <i>morning meal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				2.381
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				10.578
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				19.171s
			</span></i>q., <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				15.94s
			</span></i>q., <i><span class="en">
				500
			</span></i>; sts. 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόρπον</span>
			, <i>evening meal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				17.176
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				20.390s
			</span></i>q.; later,<i>the midday meal,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῖτον εἰδέναι διώρισα, ἄριστα,
					δεῖπνα, δόρπα θ᾽ αἱρεῖσθαι τρίτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					182
				</span></i>
			; later, <i>the afternoon meal, dinner</i> or <i>supper,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοὶ δὲ μελήσει, ὅτανᾖ δεκάπουν τὸ
					στοιχεῖον, λιπαρῷ χωρεῖν ἐπὶ δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					652
				</span></i>
			: freq. in pl., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				779
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>El.</u>
				203
			</span></i>(lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. Θυέστου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					1008
				</span></i>
			(lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ δείπνου</span>
			straight-way after <i>the meal,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ δ. αὐτοῦ θωρήσσοντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.54
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				1.17
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλεῖν ἐπὶ δεῖπνον, κεκλῆσθαι
				ἐπὶ δ.,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				72
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				119.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. παρασκευάζειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pherecr.
					45
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				172
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραθεῖναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					184
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dionys.Com.
					2.4
				</span></i>
			; of animals, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
				<u>Epigr.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				1.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				12.27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>food, provender,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵπποισιν δεῖπνον δότε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.383
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρνισι δεῖπνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					801
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοράκεσσιν</span> Epigr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Her.</u>
				19.17
			</span></i>.</div>
